TI  - Evaluation of the Code Generated By Large Language Models: The State of the Art
PY  - 2025
T2  - Proceedings - 2025 IEEE 49th Annual Computers, Software, and Applications Conference, COMPSAC 2025
SP  - 440
EP  - 449
DO  - 10.1109/COMPSAC65507.2025.00064
