TI  - Evaluating a Human-Agent Supervised LLM-Driven Methodology for Internet Routing Security Software Development
PY  - 2025
T2  - Lecture Notes in Networks and Systems
VL  - 1567 LNNS
SP  - 205
EP  - 225
DO  - 10.1007/978-3-032-00071-2_13
