TI  - Investigating the Impact of AI-Assisted Tools on Software Practitioner Well-Being
PY  - 2025
T2  - Proceedings of IEEE Symposium on Visual Languages and Human-Centric Computing, VL/HCC
SP  - 447
EP  - 449
DO  - 10.1109/VL-HCC65237.2025.00068
