TI  - Generative AI-Assisted Pair Programming: A New Era of Collaboration
PY  - 2025
T2  - Generative AI for Software Development: Code Generation, Error Detection, Software Testing
SP  - 121
EP  - 144
DO  - 10.1515/9783111677798-006
